# What issuing this host's certificate reads.
#
# `VPS_ADMIN_EMAIL` is optional because the script has a deliberate answer for
# its absence — configure renewal, issue nothing, print the command to run by
# hand — and the point of declaring it here is that a run says so at the top
# rather than in the middle.
VPS_DOMAIN_NAME: the name the certificate is issued for
VPS_ADMIN_EMAIL?: unset issues nothing; certbot only gets its renewal hooks
DNS_PROVIDER?: set to issue a wildcard over DNS-01; unset means HTTP-01, apex only
DNS_API_TOKEN?: credentials for DNS_PROVIDER, once one is named
